  <h1>Observation Fibers, Standpoint Alignment &amp; Exact Symbolic Intelligence</h1>
  <p class="lede">Intelligence is not statistical token prediction over untyped byte streams. Every real agent operates inside a partial-observation <strong>interaction network</strong>: its knowledge is the fiber of compatible world-histories, warrant is invariance across the entire fiber, and intelligence itself is exact compression of the record.</p>

